# SHA-256 manifest of the model files doormand loads, in `sha256sum` format
# (`<64 hex>  <file name>`; names only, no paths). Compiled into the daemon
# (daemon/src/model_integrity.rs) and checked against the files in
# `[ml] models_dir` at every start. The values are the pinned hashes of
# scripts/fetch_models.sh. A loaded file that is listed here and does not match
# makes the daemon refuse to start (override: `[models] allow_unverified_models`).
# Files not listed (for example the depth model, which has no pinned upstream
# hash in this repository) are reported as unverified; add them with
# `[models] manifest_path` (see docs/MODELS.md, "Integrity manifest").
